# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and working tree (W993).
# Rationale: mixed EOL (CRLF blobs + autocrlf worktrees) caused a whack-a-mole series
# of failures — bare-LF injections by tooling into CRLF files, mixed-EOL fail-closed
# trips in batch_cascade, and \n-anchored patches failing on \r\n files (W971-W989 era).
# From W993 on: blobs are LF, worktrees are LF, tools build with \n unconditionally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Linguist: exclude generated site artifacts from language statistics (W1205)
# Rationale: OSSF Scorecard's Fuzzing check only scans *prominent* languages, where the
#   threshold = (total bytes from GitHub /languages) / (language count) / 4. With site/**
#   counted in, the threshold was 2,049,668 bytes and TypeScript (605,934 B) fell below it
#   => the probe never scanned our TS fuzz target, so Scorecard reported
#   "no fuzzer integrations found" despite a real Jazzer.js + fast-check setup.
#   Marking site/** as generated removes build artifacts from the statistics, so the
#   existing fast-check marker in xiyouji-agent-web/fuzz/fastcheck.test.ts becomes visible.
# Note: effect is verified by GitHub's async re-statistics; the next scheduled Scorecard
#   run (weekly) is the verification point. See pitfalls E-222 / W1205 notes.
site/** linguist-generated=true
#   run (weekly) is the verification point.
# Binary assets (explicit — never normalize)
*.png -text
*.webp -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
*.gif -text
*.ico -text
*.woff -text
*.woff2 -text
*.ttf -text
*.eot -text
*.otf -text
*.pdf -text
*.zip -text
*.mp3 -text
*.mp4 -text
*.webm -text
*.psd -text
*.ai -text
assets/promo/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# W1214（根修 CI 第 45 槽红灯·本地绿/CI 红的真因）：W1209 迁移时 `**/*.md` 排除**确实生效**
# （取证：改写后 W1096 commit 的 assets/promo 下 12 个 md 全是普通文本），但同批把 migrate
# 自动生成的 `**/*.md !text -filter -merge -diff` 排除行**整行删除**（理由：`!text` 压制 W993 的
# LF 规范化、`-diff` 让 md 被当二进制）⇒ **连同 filter/merge 的排除语义一起消失** ⇒ 此后凡被
# `git add` 的 assets/promo 下文本文件都走 LFS clean filter ⇒ 落成 LFS 指针（实测 8 个 md + 2 个 html）。
# CI 的 actions/checkout 默认不拉 LFS 真身 ⇒ 工作树是指针文本 ⇒ 第 45 槽 parse_index() 返回 None
# ⇒ C2「INDEX.md 结构不合生成器模板」× 6 目录 ⇒ Delivery Gate 红 ⇒ required check 未过 ⇒ PR 硬拦。
# 本批恢复排除语义，且**不重犯 W1209 的两个副作用**（不压制 LF 规范化、不禁用文本 diff）：
#   -filter          清除 LFS clean/smudge filter（⇒ 不再落成指针）
#   -merge           清除 merge=lfs
#   diff             覆盖 diff=lfs（保留文本 diff：审计/改写面判据依赖它）
#   text eol=lf      强制文本 + LF（承接 W993 的行尾定形，替代被删掉的 `!text`）
# 范围：md 全仓（文本文件本就不该进 LFS）；html 仅 assets/promo（site/ 产物量大，本批不动）。
*.md -filter -merge diff text eol=lf
assets/promo/**/*.html -filter -merge diff text eol=lf
